	"Description": "基于FF框架的动态家具，[b]只能1.6版本用[/b]\n<br />[img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1303/images/26139/26139-1721144510-1884849266.gif[/img]\n<br />非常推荐使用村民美化替换我的初始资产（就是assets文件夹内的图片）！\n<br />[img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1303/images/26139/26139-1723823037-1048399551.gif[/img]\n<br />[b]【完成中】下版本计划是制作自定义npc村民的动画家具！你可以评论留下相关npc模组链接[/b]\n<br />[b]自定义npc需要找到对应模组的行走图替换我的空图片！[/b]\n<br />\n<br />感谢猫柚的返图=3=\n<br />\n<br />only for 1.6!\u00A0 \u00A0\u00A0Highly recommend replacing my assets with villager\u00A0sprites mods！\n<br />[b]The plan for the next version is to create Custom NPC for animated furniture！You can comment and leave a link to the Custom NPC mod you want to make furniture for![/b]\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[i]下面是我很喜欢的一些村民行走图美化：\n<br />Here are some of my favorite sprites mods：[/i]\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/20410]Girls Catwalk\u00A0Created by Millie[/url]\u00A0\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/25069]Sebastian's Sprites by Macchiato[/url]\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9016]Baechu-Style Sprites (Sam Sebastian Emily Shane Kent Penny Maru Elliott)[/url]",
